{
  "uid": "mysql-ha-lab-apps",
  "title": "4 \u00b7 Applications",
  "description": "Success, failures, errors absorbed by retry, latency and stale reads per lab application.",
  "tags": [
    "mysql-ha"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "MySQL HA dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "mysql-ha"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "application",
        "label": "Application",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(app_db_ops_total, application)",
          "refId": "PrometheusVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(app_db_ops_total, application)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        },
        "sort": 1
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "name": "App writer path down/up",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "red",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "expr": "changes(app_db_probe_up{target=\"writer\"}[10s]) > 0",
        "step": "5s",
        "titleFormat": "{{application}}: writer path changed",
        "tagKeys": "application",
        "useValueForTime": false
      },
      {
        "name": "Primary changed",
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "purple",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "expr": "max by (member_host) (mysql_perf_schema_replication_group_member_info{member_role=\"PRIMARY\"}) unless max by (member_host) (mysql_perf_schema_replication_group_member_info{member_role=\"PRIMARY\"} offset 15s)",
        "step": "5s",
        "titleFormat": "new primary: {{member_host}}",
        "tagKeys": "member_host",
        "useValueForTime": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 4 \u00b7 Applications \u2014 what do the apps experience?\nEvery database operation goes through **Retry**: *ok* = first attempt, *retried* = succeeded after a failover error, *failed* = the user got a 503.\nA good failover looks like: **retried \u2191, errors absorbed \u2191, latency spike, failed = 0**. Choose the app with **Application** (top left)."
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Result: did users notice?",
      "id": 2,
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Write success % (range)",
      "description": "Writes that succeeded (first try or after retry) in the selected range.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "100 * sum by (application) (increase(app_db_ops_total{kind=\"write\",outcome!=\"failed\",application=~\"$application\"}[$__range])) / sum by (application) (increase(app_db_ops_total{kind=\"write\",application=~\"$application\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{application}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 99
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 99.9
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 2,
          "noValue": "no writes"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "id": 3,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
